    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011140/extras/41f862e8d34d139adbd01fef3fb565eb.poster.avif?t=1593595855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011140/extras/41f862e8d34d139adbd01fef3fb565eb.webm?t=1593595855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011140/extras/41f862e8d34d139adbd01fef3fb565eb.mp4?t=1593595855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Defend America from murderous zombie hordes, waves of unwashed orcs, and the military strength of enemy nations all bent on the destruction of the homeland. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011140/extras/3075ef9cad3d723cd69347c1c5cd817a.avif?t=1593595855\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>unrelenting wave-based combat requiring skill, speed and plenty of ammo pickups to overcome the onsalught of enemies.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle across six maps with a variety of enemies and enemy types </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Repel hostile invaders with an arsenal of weaponry fit for a border guard and take back control of the border.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011140/extras/33f80e641e36659f281efc3531591a56.poster.avif?t=1593595855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011140/extras/33f80e641e36659f281efc3531591a56.webm?t=1593595855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011140/extras/33f80e641e36659f281efc3531591a56.mp4?t=1593595855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><